<title>PHILIPPINES: Pedro sets 30 percent stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Pedro sets 30 percent stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine sugar refiner Centro Azucarera Don Pedro declared on Tuesday a 30 percent stock dividend to all shareholders on record February 20, the Philippine Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The exchange said in its notice to brokers the dividend is subject to approval by stockholders at the annual meeting on Wednesday. -- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
